s, valley branches, foothill approaches, pasture and oasis/coastal margins. Natural Earth river geometries are retained under data/geography/natural-earth-rivers.source.geojson; smaller reference corridors remain explicitly reconstructed. Variable-width ribbons replace filled compact basin patches, and active channel cores / declared unsuitable patches / open water are excluded from terminal placement. Post-arrival dispersal takes 240 modeled calendar years along the supplied land-checked path; these are display assumptions, not source arrival dates or observed settlements. Path and dates are reconstructed."}},"UNHG":{"points":[[31.755308,49.778082],[35.422956,48.022052],[31.046134,47.426193],[34.831237,48.237322],[34.055844,47.44521],[30.040904,46.815861],[30.019611,48.40489],[28.803611,47.333602],[29.633798,48.234692],[35.339426,47.876761],[30.225928,51.396509],[28.520766,49.100649],[32.117505,49.618251],[30.428203,50.260744],[31.102441,48.08288],[29.537063,46.645805],[35.306657,48.539483],[34.831433,48.608314],[29.605775,47.010019],[31.18188,50.119438],[29.457662,48.723426],[28.728267,47.802533],[33.311619,49.251915],[28.986052,48.563468],[33.576158,49.116356],[31.301656,49.368794],[28.728901,48.214088],[30.43795,51.804898],[31.418956,47.275166],[33.748157,47.190573],[31.003635,49.819221],[30.265197,48.335186],[29.210222,46.930603],[34.471601,48.883633],[30.114478,48.023736],[35.402326,48.210946],[32.509976,49.053204],[29.358676,47.471564],[30.901307,51.688415],[28.42761,48.797402],[32.082954,49.779835],[31.396213,47.792683],[35.374439,48.219198],[33.828222,49.201246],[31.807727,49.32365],[28.998121,47.977107],[30.253702,51.407107],[28.620253,49.354159],[31.799774,49.637973],[28.23218,49.280712],[30.859687,48.219817],[34.970606,47.831814],[30.819593,51.426053],[29.291835,48.880648],[28.588722,47.811499],[33.063679,49.416812],[28.928433,48.655289],[31.624019,47.631693],[28.482978,48.302743],[31.253314,47.419707],[34.595142,48.370586],[33.942506,47.344638],[31.4893